From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Pearson <tpearson@raptorengineering.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:33:59 +1100
Subject: build: add missing MC sources to the bundled LLVM

The PowerPC target needs MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter, MCAsmInfoXCOFF and
MCInstrInfo.

Origin: Debian chromium packaging, debian/patches/ppc64le/third_party/0001-swiftshader-fix-build.patch (156.0.8078.79-1).

diff --git a/third_party/llvm-16.0/BUILD.gn b/third_party/llvm-16.0/BUILD.gn
index c7f62d9c744b1b1acfcc75cb823df3e7c5201122..c1ffb0fa1b0215ff063bd294c12d70d93486cf20 100644
--- a/third_party/llvm-16.0/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/llvm-16.0/BUILD.gn
@@ -1599,6 +1599,9 @@ swiftshader_llvm_source_set("swiftshader_llvm_ppc") {
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/PPCVSXFMAMutate.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/PPCVSXSwapRemoval.cpp",
     "llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/TargetInfo/PowerPCTargetInfo.cpp",
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCXCOFFObjectTargetWriter.cpp",
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCAsmInfoXCOFF.cpp",
+    "llvm/lib/MC/MCInstrInfo.cpp",
   ]
 }
 
